<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta stock exchange closed for Good Friday.</title>
<headline>Jakarta stock exchange closed for Good Friday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta Stock Exchange was closed on Friday for the Easter holiday.</p>
<p>The market will also be closed on Monday, the last day of the fiscal year, and will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the composite index ended up 2.84 points, or 0.43 percent, at 662.24 points.</p>
